<p>You have learned to sing the praises of the Moons, in the form of three defensive Hymns:</p><p></p><p>Hymn of Shadows: Increases your movement speed by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">1%, 1%, 3%, 4%, 5%</acronym> and your spell casting speed by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">0%, 0%, 1%, 1%, 2%.</acronym></p><p></p><p>Hymn of Detection: Increases your ability to see stealthy creatures by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">0, 0, 1, 1, 2</acronym> and invisible creatures by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">0, 0, 1, 1, 2,</acronym> and increases your critical power by <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">0%, 1%, 2%, 4%, 5%.</acronym></p><p></p><p>Hymn of Perseverance: Increases your resistance to stun, confusion and blinding by 10%.</p><p></p><p>You may only have one Hymn active at a time.</p>